# Node
node_modules/

# Vendored OpenJPEG is kept complete on disk but only the openjp2 parts the
# WASM build needs are tracked. The rest (docs, CI, tests, tools, encoders,
# Java binding, bundled third-party libz/png/tiff/lcms2/astyle) stays local,
# untracked — verified unused by a fresh out-of-tree build.
third_party/openjpeg/.github/
third_party/openjpeg/scripts/
third_party/openjpeg/doc/
third_party/openjpeg/tests/
third_party/openjpeg/tools/
third_party/openjpeg/thirdparty/
third_party/openjpeg/src/bin/
third_party/openjpeg/wrapping/java/
third_party/openjpeg/CTestConfig.cmake
third_party/openjpeg/appveyor.yml
third_party/openjpeg/.travis.yml
third_party/openjpeg/AUTHORS.md
third_party/openjpeg/CHANGELOG.md
third_party/openjpeg/HOWTO-RELEASE
third_party/openjpeg/INSTALL.md
third_party/openjpeg/NEWS.md
third_party/openjpeg/README.md
third_party/openjpeg/THANKS.md